  "title": "Juicy Kenyan Raspberry Braise",
  "description": "A pungent and crunchy Kenyan dish featuring raspberries in a flavorful braise, perfect for the monsoon season, this recipe is low in calories and rich in nutrients. It combines the sweetness of raspberries with the heartiness of a braise.",
