  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the ground cumin, coriander, and turmeric, and stir well.",
    "Add the raspberries, salt, and black pepper, and stir gently.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir occasionally to prevent the raspberries from sticking to the pan.",
    "Serve the braise hot, garnished with fresh raspberries and herbs if desired."
  ],
